SCOPE NOTE — what this license does and does not cover

This license covers the code, tests, rubric and documentation authored in this
repository.

It does NOT purport to license any material derived from the source dataset
(`cnamuangtoun/resume-job-description-fit`), which declares no license of its
own. Specifically, `data/reference/labels-v1.jsonl` contains verbatim
requirement strings and annotator notes quoting that corpus, and shorter
fragments appear in `data/variants/variants-v1.json` and three files under
`docs/findings/`. Those fragments are retained for research reproducibility and
are not relicensed here; see `data/README.md`.

The corpus itself is not redistributed — it is gitignored and reachable only
through the pinned download script and checksum.
